@* "Покажи разликите" over a table of code tests (sl-code-diff.js); the table is inside the same [data-diff-scope]. *@
<div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" data-diff-toggle aria-pressed="false">
        <i class="bi bi-file-diff" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span data-diff-label>Покажи разликите</span>
    </button>
    <span class="small text-body-secondary" data-diff-legend hidden>
        <mark class="sl-diff">Оцветено</mark> е различното; <mark class="sl-diff">·</mark> = интервал, <mark class="sl-diff">⏎</mark> = празен ред.
        Интервалите в края на реда и празните редове накрая не се броят.
    </span>
</div>
